{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】一股清勁至強風程度的東北季候風正影響廣東沿岸。本港地區今日(10月29日)天氣預測，大致多雲。初時有一兩陣微雨。日間漸轉天晴及乾燥，最高氣溫約29度。吹和緩至清勁東風，初時離岸及高地間中吹強風。</p>\n<p>展望未來一兩日日間大致天晴及乾燥。星期日雲量增多。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T23:20:38.611982+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":131,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T23:02:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T23:18:23.824234+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T23:18:23.824234+00:00","content_hash":"386ea0fda778e8bdaa2c375579b19b509ace1ce8cc8bf8f6b7b8fb9cf7a52ee0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}